  <https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/2026-10-20T121500Z-core-ontology> a prov:Activity , dct:ProvenanceStatement ;
    rdfs:label "Core domain ontology imports the core taxonomies, 2026-10-20T12:15:00Z"@en ;
    dct:description "The core domain ontology now imports the 23 core taxonomies (owl:imports), so it includes every core taxonomy and its concepts; concepts stay linked to their classes by core:formalizedBy, stated in the taxonomies. No class, relation or concept changed; version stays 0.1.0 (Draft). Source ingest/core/ontology-core.source.ttl updated to match. Changed outside the KE Workbench pages at the direction of Jeffrey Wallk."@en ;
    dct:creator "Jeffrey Wallk" ;
